{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2800840/extras/d517860ca165a9cc581722607bf9b903.avif?t=1772899049\" width=800 height=280 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Kick your builds into overdrive with <strong>Gunbot Engineer</strong>! Introducing <strong>Addons</strong>, meta progression rewards that allow you to build up power between runs and\u00a0open up new ways to customize and amp up your builds!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Also featuring: Several new <strong>Weapon Evolves</strong> to discover and build around; <strong>Pepper Spray</strong>, a spicy new weapon; and new Modules and Upgrades to open new avenues for your builds!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2800840/extras/2b861fff4cfd425e8df70d9f095c9674.poster.avif?t=1772899049\" width=1170 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2800840/extras/2b861fff4cfd425e8df70d9f095c9674.webm?t=1772899049\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Assemble the perfect arsenal of weapons, from nuclear footballs to fire extinguishers that spray electrified flames. Rewire your Gunbot - frame and (artificial) brain - whether it's for speed, durability, or straight up firepower. Welcome to the wasteland; now pick your flavor of carnage!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>Features:</strong></u> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-<strong>Infinite replayability!</strong> No two bots are the same, so no two runs are the same!<br><br>-Mix and match from<strong> over 20 base weapons</strong> and customize them using <strong>25+ types of augments and boosters</strong> to suit your build on a <strong>unique hexagonal upgrade grid</strong>! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2800840/extras/7b5088344b75ea923e1cbd727d6fb60e.poster.avif?t=1772899049\" width=1170 height=464 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2800840/extras/7b5088344b75ea923e1cbd727d6fb60e.webm?t=1772899049\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Choose from <strong>more than 80 build-defining modules</strong> - it's not like messing with Gunbot AI lead to the downfall of all human civilization or anything!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > -Fast-paced gameplay: let your weapons do the talking and splatter your enemies across the desert, while you dodge out of harm's way! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-<strong>10 base Gunbots</strong> to choose from, from the gallant <i>LanceBot</i> to the <i>Freezer</i>, the best armed fridge the world has ever seen!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Discover hidden combinations for <strong>special evolved weapons</strong> to kick your build into overdrive!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2800840/extras/6d0d55ba9a02097535d994b1f49a526a.avif?t=1772899049\" width=600 height=195 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Fun and varied enemies: oozified office workers still on their 9-to-5 grind, brawl boys who just want to fight everything that moves, skittering spine-slinging crab/cactus hybrids, and so much more!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Special <strong>Hazard and Boss levels</strong> to test your build - and skills - in unique conditions!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2800840/extras/e0329d7e3e0402fdf5e22dc4ae691444.poster.avif?t=1772899049\" width=1170 height=546 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2800840/extras/e0329d7e3e0402fdf5e22dc4ae691444.webm?t=1772899049\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Let your gunbot's automated targeting systems handle the firing - or select which weapons you want to manually aim for optimal control!</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"All-Rounder","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2800840/0ac9b3e376b917c28959de95122d9535f2524985.jpg"},{"name":"Bomb Bot","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2800840/603fe6e58d3c5eb67ced5eac3600e75c2cbde259.jpg"},{"name":"Lucky","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2800840/999207867a76a936a410e9dc261f0e4d1e72cc1f.jpg"},{"name":"Dot Bot","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2800840/7ba2675b29c4d809b07a6223fa90c732a291a19a.jpg"},{"name":"Intern Bot","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2800840/1afd13701ba933f5834b51a5eff1b711418c43cf.jpg"},{"name":"Desperado","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2800840/b603fea46e7bc49677516880b0ad8626f4150667.jpg"},{"name":"Lance-Bot","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2800840/4c690c66c4cb7853387fad4b761ebe39b1350c6d.jpg"},{"name":"Scrappy","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2800840/269b342169a4554eb4f362b